OL,3,AMeta hooked children on Facebook and
OL,4,AInstagram, US court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court has heard claims Meta
OL,7,Fintentionally hooked a generation of
OL,8,Fchildren on Facebook and Instagram, as
OL,9,Fthe biggest legal challenge faced by
OL,10,Fthe social media platform began.
OL,12,FA jury in Oakland, California will
OL,13,Fspend the next six weeks wading through
OL,14,Fclaims by top attorneys from several US
OL,15,Fstates and lawyers for the social media
OL,16,Fcompany.
OL,18,FA lawyer for California claimed Meta
OL,19,Ffound "millions" of 11 and 12-year-olds
OL,20,Fwere on Instagram and "did little to
OL,21,Fkeep them off" as the trial opened on
OL,22,FTuesday.
